  "goodToKnow": "Die Nische is a niche or alcove: eine Wandnische, eine Marktnische. Many German Mittelstand firms are hidden champions, world leaders in small market niches, like screws or organ pipes. The GDR has been described as a Nischengesellschaft (niche society), as people retreated into private spaces such as allotment gardens and dachas away from the state. Pronounced NEE-she. Plural: die Nischen."
